WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 31

01:27.800 --> 01:32.320
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

01:32.720 --> 01:34.010
Your Highness,

01:34.030 --> 01:35.370
Prince Yan went

01:35.370 --> 01:36.560
to the Astronomy again today,

01:36.560 --> 01:38.040
using another excuse.

01:42.440 --> 01:43.960
Let him investigate.

01:44.680 --> 01:47.060
All the evidence
was destroyed back then.

01:47.080 --> 01:49.480
He's just wasting his time.

01:50.640 --> 01:52.080
I understand,

01:52.560 --> 01:54.100
but what's strange is

01:54.120 --> 01:55.320
that halfway through the files,

01:55.320 --> 01:56.280
Prince Yan secretly ran

01:56.280 --> 01:58.400
to the back garden

01:58.640 --> 02:00.060
and dug up a tree.

02:00.080 --> 02:01.660
Why would he dig up a tree?

02:02.040 --> 02:04.220
There was a jar of wine
buried beneath it.

02:04.240 --> 02:05.320
I've worked at the Astronomy

02:05.320 --> 02:06.880
for so many years,

02:07.200 --> 02:08.120
yet I never knew

02:08.120 --> 02:10.040
there was wine buried there.

02:10.320 --> 02:11.680
I'm worried that inside that jar,

02:11.680 --> 02:12.780
instead of wine,

02:12.800 --> 02:14.340
there might be evidence.

02:14.360 --> 02:16.220
If Prince Yan finds out...

02:16.240 --> 02:17.680
Well...

02:18.200 --> 02:20.020
Did someone else know

02:20.040 --> 02:21.940
about what happened back then?

02:21.960 --> 02:23.580
Your Highness, rest assured.

02:23.920 --> 02:25.160
Mr. Chu and Mr. Xiao

02:25.160 --> 02:26.580
have been dealt with.

02:26.600 --> 02:28.740
Now, only you and I

02:28.760 --> 02:31.000
know the truth.

02:31.200 --> 02:32.760
Since that's the case,

02:33.120 --> 02:34.960
if Prince Yan finds out anything,

02:35.320 --> 02:37.920
it means you betrayed me.

02:40.240 --> 02:43.120
I'd never dare betray you.

02:45.160 --> 02:47.000
I'll believe you for now.

02:51.640 --> 02:52.760
This is an antidote.

02:52.780 --> 02:53.760
Apply it to your wound,

02:53.760 --> 02:54.780
and you'll be fine.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.240
Thank you, Miss.

02:56.920 --> 02:58.260
Then...

02:58.280 --> 03:00.180
Your Highness, Miss,

03:00.200 --> 03:01.480
shall I escort you out?

03:01.480 --> 03:03.140
No need, I know the way.

03:03.160 --> 03:04.600
You may leave.

03:08.600 --> 03:09.820
Did you really poison her?

03:09.840 --> 03:10.700
Of course not.

03:10.710 --> 03:12.100
I just scared her a little.

03:12.120 --> 03:13.820
I only sprinkled some pollen

03:13.840 --> 03:15.160
on her wound

03:15.160 --> 03:16.780
to make it itch.

03:16.800 --> 03:18.100
Where's the antidote from then?

03:18.120 --> 03:19.460
That was just a scented pill.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.540
I couldn't admit

03:20.560 --> 03:21.560
there was no poison,

03:21.560 --> 03:23.660
or how would I trick her in the future?

03:24.200 --> 03:25.600
This way, they'll think twice

03:25.600 --> 03:27.320
before coming after you again.

03:28.240 --> 03:30.600
Brilliant, two birds with one stone.

03:34.920 --> 03:35.800
Why hasn't the mentor

03:35.800 --> 03:37.420
(Peace and Prosperity)
my parents invited

03:37.420 --> 03:38.940
arrived here?

03:39.080 --> 03:41.560
I've been waiting
for an incense stick of time.

03:42.480 --> 03:44.140
The new mentor has official duties

03:44.160 --> 03:45.940
and is taking time out to teach you.

03:45.960 --> 03:47.800
Your Highness, please be patient.

03:48.310 --> 03:49.670
Shh.

03:50.160 --> 03:51.600
Someone's coming.

03:53.680 --> 03:56.680
I'm Zhen Heng.
Greetings, Princess Fuqing.

03:57.080 --> 03:58.640
On, it's Mr. Zhen.

03:58.880 --> 04:00.960
You're my new mentor?

04:01.840 --> 04:03.060
I'm not knowledgeable enough,

04:03.080 --> 04:05.900
but I will dedicate
my lifelong knowledge

04:05.920 --> 04:07.240
to honor the trust of His Majesty

04:07.240 --> 04:08.500
and Her Highness.

04:08.520 --> 04:10.040
Mr. Zhen, have a seat.

04:11.280 --> 04:12.720
Thank you.

04:18.520 --> 04:21.400
His Majesty ordered me to teach you,

04:21.480 --> 04:23.380
but he did not specify what to teach.

04:23.400 --> 04:26.020
Today, I brought the Four Books
and Five Classics,

04:26.040 --> 04:28.580
Shiji, Zhenguan Zhengyao,

04:28.600 --> 04:30.880
and Lüshi Chunqiu.

04:31.960 --> 04:33.040
Mr. Zhen, you truly are

04:33.040 --> 04:35.320
sharing everything you have.

04:35.640 --> 04:38.600
It's my honor to teach you.

04:50.760 --> 04:52.000
I pulled these

04:52.000 --> 04:54.400
one by one from the mountains.

04:54.560 --> 04:55.520
Jiang Zhan,

04:55.520 --> 04:57.600
do you have a grudge against me?

04:58.160 --> 05:00.920
Chuchu, do you know
how to make fragrance?

05:01.480 --> 05:02.640
I've seen my sister do it.

05:02.640 --> 05:03.900
It looked simple.

05:03.920 --> 05:05.080
But when I try,

05:05.080 --> 05:07.040
I realize I can't make anything.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.660
I'll take you to apply some medicine.

05:15.680 --> 05:17.120
No need.

05:20.400 --> 05:22.080
What exactly happened?

05:23.560 --> 05:25.000
Nothing.

05:25.640 --> 05:27.120
Last time, when Jiang Si recovered,

05:27.140 --> 05:28.760
I knew you had
family matters to discuss,

05:28.760 --> 05:30.340
so I didn't ask much.

05:30.360 --> 05:32.440
Did something else happen afterward?

05:33.840 --> 05:35.360
I promised my father

05:36.200 --> 05:37.680
that I wouldn't say

05:38.600 --> 05:39.860
or do anything.

05:39.880 --> 05:41.000
So, you feel stifled?

05:41.000 --> 05:42.440
No.

05:43.760 --> 05:45.620
Are you stupid?

05:45.640 --> 05:47.240
If you need to vent, why pick something

05:47.240 --> 05:48.540
you're bad at?

05:48.560 --> 05:50.560
Won't that make your feel worse?

05:51.080 --> 05:52.180
Besides,

05:52.200 --> 05:53.680
you ruined my precious fragrances.

05:53.680 --> 05:54.720
Look at my hands.

05:54.720 --> 05:56.360
Don't you feel sorry for me?

05:57.640 --> 05:59.480
Why do you have so many wounds?

05:59.780 --> 06:01.720
Let me apply some medicine for you.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.100
In the martial world,

06:04.120 --> 06:05.840
these small wounds are nothing.

06:06.120 --> 06:08.000
Come on, I'll take you somewhere.

06:08.160 --> 06:09.300
I'm not going.

06:09.320 --> 06:10.800
It'll be fun.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.360
You look so down.

06:13.360 --> 06:14.600
I have to help you relax.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.020
It'll make you feel better.

06:16.040 --> 06:16.920
Besides,

06:16.920 --> 06:18.480
we're so close.

06:22.240 --> 06:25.380
Even if we're just siblings,

06:25.400 --> 06:27.040
you should've still told me.

06:38.160 --> 06:42.040
Actually, the poison
Aunt Xiao gave to Si

06:43.040 --> 06:44.940
was ordered by the Grand Princess.

06:47.000 --> 06:49.440
I always thought my mother
died of illness,

06:50.680 --> 06:53.120
but she was poisoned by Her Highness.

06:56.200 --> 06:59.840
So much has happened,

07:01.880 --> 07:03.840
yet I brought you here to grill fish.

07:05.520 --> 07:06.960
I'm sorry.

07:07.200 --> 07:09.120
What should we do next?

07:10.320 --> 07:13.160
I told you because I didn't want
to hide it from you,

07:13.480 --> 07:14.460
but I will never let you

07:14.460 --> 07:15.820
take this risk with me.

07:15.840 --> 07:17.140
How can that be?

07:17.160 --> 07:19.600
Is there really nothing I can do?

07:25.000 --> 07:26.880
You've done so much for me.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.240
This is just the beginning.

07:33.000 --> 07:34.820
- I...
- Come with me.

07:34.840 --> 07:36.280
- What for?
- Let's go.

07:36.280 --> 07:37.880
What about the fish?

07:43.260 --> 07:44.990
♪ From place to place ♪

07:44.990 --> 07:49.930
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

07:50.300 --> 07:52.680
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

07:52.680 --> 07:56.910
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

07:57.620 --> 08:00.020
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

08:00.040 --> 08:03.700
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall
and take root ♪

08:03.720 --> 08:07.140
♪ Growing between us ♪

08:07.290 --> 08:12.810
♪ And breeding love ♪

08:18.040 --> 08:19.940
Greetings, Your Highness.

08:19.960 --> 08:21.680
May you be blessed.

08:22.040 --> 08:25.200
No need for such formalities.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.460
(Sunshine and Luxury)
I'm delighted

08:27.480 --> 08:29.440
that you came to see me.

08:29.460 --> 08:30.360
Please, have a seat.

08:30.360 --> 08:32.040
Thank you, Your Highness.

08:32.240 --> 08:34.940
Prince Yan and Miss Jiang

08:34.960 --> 08:36.660
truly make a perfect couple.

08:36.680 --> 08:39.960
Even I find it a pleasing sight.

08:40.000 --> 08:43.440
It has been too long
since the last joyous occasion.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.760
We should have a grand celebration.

08:45.760 --> 08:47.480
Your Highness, you flatter us.

08:48.560 --> 08:49.860
Your Highness,

08:49.880 --> 08:52.480
this is from the banquet that day...

08:52.480 --> 08:53.400
Yes.

08:53.400 --> 08:57.060
I was fond of this exquisiteness,

08:57.080 --> 08:58.460
so I asked Ms. Duo

08:58.480 --> 08:59.820
to bring the Spring Amidst Trees

08:59.840 --> 09:01.540
back to Changning Palace,

09:01.560 --> 09:03.200
hoping for good fortune.

09:03.200 --> 09:05.400
Princess Fuqing is here.

09:05.680 --> 09:07.680
Your Highness, mind the threshold.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.080
Ms. Hua,

09:09.100 --> 09:10.740
you don't have to remind me
every time.

09:10.760 --> 09:11.760
I've stepped over this

09:11.760 --> 09:12.920
countless times.

09:12.920 --> 09:14.100
Fuqing,

09:14.120 --> 09:15.340
your brother

09:15.360 --> 09:17.620
and his future wife are here.

09:17.640 --> 09:19.200
Come and greet them.

09:19.560 --> 09:20.740
Fuqing.

09:20.760 --> 09:23.420
I'm Jiang Si.
Greetings, Princess Fuqing.

09:23.440 --> 09:25.400
Greetings, Jin.

09:25.560 --> 09:27.140
Greetings, Miss Jiang.

09:27.160 --> 09:28.440
Miss Jiang prepared

09:28.440 --> 09:30.220
this fragrance for you.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.800
She hopes you like it.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.960
Your Highness, please give it a try.

09:50.880 --> 09:51.980
It smells wonderful.

09:52.000 --> 09:53.460
Thank you, Miss Jiang.

09:53.480 --> 09:55.880
I wish you and Jin
a lifetime of happiness.

09:57.520 --> 09:58.960
You're welcome.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.280
Here.

10:03.160 --> 10:04.640
Your Highness,

10:04.920 --> 10:08.140
may I ask about the Princess's
eye condition?

10:08.160 --> 10:10.920
Miss Jiang, you don't know this.

10:11.640 --> 10:13.220
When Fuqing was young,

10:13.240 --> 10:15.720
she watched the fireworks
with the Emperor

10:16.280 --> 10:18.560
and was hurt by a sky lantern.

10:20.030 --> 10:21.650
May Dazhou

10:21.670 --> 10:24.760
be prosperous and peaceful.

10:24.760 --> 10:26.460
May Dazhou

10:26.460 --> 10:30.200
be prosperous and peaceful.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.540
After the sky lanterns,

10:39.560 --> 10:41.060
when I woke up the next day,

10:41.080 --> 10:42.080
I suddenly

10:42.080 --> 10:43.920
couldn't see anymore.

10:48.360 --> 10:49.500
Your Highness,

10:49.520 --> 10:52.020
I have a request.

10:52.040 --> 10:53.140
What is it?

10:53.160 --> 10:55.000
My father is only an Earl,

10:55.000 --> 10:56.200
and I'm unfamiliar

10:56.200 --> 10:57.460
with palace etiquette.

10:57.480 --> 10:59.660
Your Highness, please allow me

10:59.680 --> 11:01.260
to learn from you

11:01.280 --> 11:02.700
at Changning Palace,

11:02.720 --> 11:04.580
so I won't make mistakes

11:04.600 --> 11:06.260
during the wedding ceremony.

11:06.280 --> 11:07.820
That is not appropriate.

11:07.920 --> 11:08.880
Mother,

11:08.880 --> 11:10.780
Jin is the son of Consort Xian.

11:10.800 --> 11:12.060
By tradition and etiquette,

11:12.080 --> 11:13.400
Miss Jiang should learn

11:13.400 --> 11:15.440
from Consort Xian.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.820
To be honest,

11:16.840 --> 11:19.100
yesterday, I had a disagreement

11:19.120 --> 11:21.340
with Consort Xian in Jinhua Hall.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.680
She will not guide me

11:22.680 --> 11:24.420
with sincerity.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.980
You're the head of the harem,

11:26.000 --> 11:27.700
the lineal mother of all Princes.

11:27.720 --> 11:29.640
If I could learn from you

11:29.640 --> 11:30.920
at Changning Palace,

11:30.920 --> 11:32.520
Consort Xian would have

11:32.520 --> 11:33.940
no grounds for complaint.

11:33.960 --> 11:35.380
I only need three days.

11:35.400 --> 11:36.480
Just three days.

11:36.480 --> 11:37.980
Please, Your Highness.

11:38.000 --> 11:40.740
Mother, Consort Xian is domineering.

11:40.760 --> 11:42.960
- I fear...
- Fuqing.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.900
Since Miss Jiang has made this request,

11:44.920 --> 11:47.060
I shall grant it

11:47.080 --> 11:49.520
as a wedding gift to them.

11:49.840 --> 11:51.280
Miss Jiang,

11:51.520 --> 11:53.360
you may study etiquette
at Changning Palace

11:53.360 --> 11:54.520
for three days.

11:54.520 --> 11:56.400
Thank you, Your Highness.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.760
Slow down.

11:57.760 --> 12:01.960
(Blessings and Clarity)

12:01.960 --> 12:03.100
Why did you suddenly decide

12:03.100 --> 12:04.380
to study palace etiquette?

12:04.400 --> 12:05.560
It was too urgent

12:05.560 --> 12:07.100
to discuss it with you.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.800
Then tell me. What's going on?

12:08.800 --> 12:10.640
Princess Fuqing's eye condition

12:10.800 --> 12:12.320
is likely caused by Nanwu's gu worms.

12:12.330 --> 12:13.240
Are you sure?

12:13.240 --> 12:14.380
Pretty much.

12:14.400 --> 12:15.320
I'm thinking

12:15.320 --> 12:17.380
that following
the Princess's eye condition,

12:17.400 --> 12:18.360
we might be able

12:18.360 --> 12:20.000
to find the Nanwu woman

12:20.000 --> 12:21.180
hidden in the Palace.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.520
His Majesty has always favored

12:22.520 --> 12:23.780
the Grand Princess.

12:23.800 --> 12:25.120
The only way we can be truly safe

12:25.120 --> 12:27.020
is by obtaining proof

12:27.040 --> 12:28.340
that she's colluded with Nanwu.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.540
Princess Fuqing is

12:29.560 --> 12:31.740
clearly a kind and reasonable girl.

12:31.760 --> 12:34.360
She's so young, yet unable to see.

12:34.720 --> 12:37.540
If we can cure her eyes,

12:37.560 --> 12:39.440
that'd be a good deed.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.100
Don't worry.

12:42.120 --> 12:44.320
It's just three days, okay?

12:45.000 --> 12:46.140
Fine.

12:46.160 --> 12:48.240
I'll pick you up in three days.

12:50.720 --> 12:52.180
Your Highness,

12:52.200 --> 12:55.760
may I ask if the mole
near the Princess's eye

12:55.840 --> 12:57.600
was there since birth,

12:57.640 --> 12:58.640
or if it appeared

12:58.640 --> 12:59.860
after she lost her sight?

12:59.880 --> 13:01.880
Fuqing was born

13:01.920 --> 13:03.960
without a mole near her eye.

13:04.400 --> 13:05.940
Now that you mention it,

13:06.080 --> 13:07.160
that mole

13:07.160 --> 13:08.520
only appeared

13:08.520 --> 13:10.120
after she became blind.

13:12.320 --> 13:13.780
Was its color light

13:13.800 --> 13:15.460
at first,

13:15.480 --> 13:18.300
but it deepened over the years?

13:18.320 --> 13:19.760
Yes.

13:20.440 --> 13:23.040
But isn't that how all moles are?

13:23.640 --> 13:25.080
That's why

13:25.480 --> 13:27.360
a small mole like that

13:28.240 --> 13:30.400
wouldn't raise suspicion.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.160
Everyone, leave us.

13:48.880 --> 13:50.400
What do you mean?

13:51.440 --> 13:52.560
Is Fuqing's mole

13:52.560 --> 13:53.860
related to her blindness?

13:53.880 --> 13:56.440
I once read in an ancient text

13:56.480 --> 13:57.820
about a Mang Worm

13:57.840 --> 13:59.620
that can reside in people's eyes,

13:59.640 --> 14:00.920
blocking their meridians

14:00.920 --> 14:02.040
and sealing their vision,

14:02.040 --> 14:03.700
plunging them into eternal darkness.

14:03.720 --> 14:05.040
The "mole" near the Princess's eye

14:05.040 --> 14:06.600
isn't a mole.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.380
It's a worm cyst.

14:08.400 --> 14:10.040
A worm cyst?

14:11.640 --> 14:13.140
So, my daughter's blindness

14:13.160 --> 14:14.160
wasn't caused

14:14.160 --> 14:16.380
by the light of the sky lanterns?

14:16.400 --> 14:17.840
Did the Mang Worm

14:18.120 --> 14:19.200
reside in Fuqing's eye

14:19.200 --> 14:20.620
on its own?

14:20.640 --> 14:23.280
These worms require careful cultivation

14:23.360 --> 14:25.280
to survive inside a human eye.

14:25.520 --> 14:27.340
Are you saying

14:27.360 --> 14:28.720
someone deliberately tried

14:28.720 --> 14:30.660
to blind Fuqing?

14:30.680 --> 14:32.120
Yes.

14:38.840 --> 14:41.000
Since the day I entered the Palace,

14:41.800 --> 14:44.440
I've never envied nor resented anyone.

14:44.720 --> 14:47.520
I've never made enemies
among the consorts.

14:48.280 --> 14:50.880
I've never scolded the maids

14:51.960 --> 14:54.960
and eunuchs in my service harshly.

14:55.800 --> 14:58.480
I have done everything I could.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.880
Why would someone

15:01.880 --> 15:03.840
still want to harm my child?

15:07.600 --> 15:10.100
She's merely a Princess,

15:10.120 --> 15:12.320
unable to fight for power or the throne.

15:12.640 --> 15:15.960
Who would be so cruel?

15:16.200 --> 15:17.540
Your Highness,

15:17.560 --> 15:18.840
we must find

15:18.840 --> 15:19.940
the culprit.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.220
Perhaps if we do,

15:21.240 --> 15:23.320
the Princess's sight

15:23.400 --> 15:25.120
may be restored.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.020
Your Highness,

15:32.040 --> 15:34.580
Jiang Si went to visit
Consort Xian yesterday

15:34.600 --> 15:36.020
and was punished.

15:36.040 --> 15:37.560
Yet today, she went to visit

15:37.560 --> 15:39.900
the Empress with Prince Yan

15:39.920 --> 15:42.840
and stayed to learn palace etiquette.

15:43.560 --> 15:46.000
She certainly knows how to adapt.

15:46.140 --> 15:48.100
Realizing that Consort Xian
won't protect her,

15:48.120 --> 15:50.540
she's now trying to gain favor
with the Empress.

15:50.560 --> 15:51.780
Unfortunately,

15:51.800 --> 15:53.720
she has chosen the wrong patron.

15:56.080 --> 15:59.080
After returning to the Palace,

15:59.120 --> 16:02.520
tell the Nanwu woman
to clean up her tracks asap.

16:02.640 --> 16:04.080
Yes.

16:04.120 --> 16:06.320
Your Highness, I'd like to ask

16:07.280 --> 16:09.200
if all your personal maids

16:09.320 --> 16:10.900
moved to Changning Palace with you

16:10.920 --> 16:13.240
before you were made Empress.

16:16.840 --> 16:18.360
Are you suggesting

16:18.800 --> 16:20.780
that the one who placed the worm

16:20.800 --> 16:23.040
is an old servant of mine?

16:23.520 --> 16:26.860
The Mang Worm is difficult
to survive in the eye.

16:26.880 --> 16:28.040
It requires careful nurturing

16:28.040 --> 16:29.640
over time.

16:29.680 --> 16:30.760
Princess Fuqing

16:30.760 --> 16:32.240
fell ill shortly

16:32.240 --> 16:33.620
before you became the Empress.

16:33.640 --> 16:35.060
So, I suspect

16:35.080 --> 16:36.160
this person must have moved

16:36.160 --> 16:37.820
to Changning Palace as well.

16:39.640 --> 16:41.080
At that time,

16:41.400 --> 16:43.320
no one in the harem

16:43.480 --> 16:44.440
could have predicted

16:44.440 --> 16:46.620
that I'd become the Empress.

16:46.640 --> 16:48.860
I have no sons.

16:48.880 --> 16:50.800
My family has no power.

16:51.280 --> 16:53.400
His Majesty never favored me.

16:55.120 --> 16:57.560
I had only five personal maids.

16:58.000 --> 17:00.120
Among them,

17:00.520 --> 17:02.780
only Ms. Hua and Ms. Duo remain.

17:02.800 --> 17:04.780
- Could it be...?
- Please don't be anxious.

17:04.800 --> 17:06.800
This is just my conjecture.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.960
It could never be them.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.340
Ms. Hua

17:11.360 --> 17:13.900
practically raised Fuqing.

17:13.920 --> 17:16.440
She cherishes her like her own eyes.

17:16.600 --> 17:19.340
Though Ms. Duo has a bad temper,

17:19.360 --> 17:21.380
whenever I was neglected and mistreated,

17:21.400 --> 17:23.760
she was always the one
who stood up for me.

17:25.960 --> 17:28.920
Your Highness, it is time for your meal.

17:34.200 --> 17:36.360
Ms. Hua, what is going on?

17:36.800 --> 17:37.900
Your Highness,

17:37.920 --> 17:40.120
the kite is stuck on the roof eaves.

17:40.880 --> 17:42.140
Is it broken?

17:42.160 --> 17:43.420
Can it still be retrieved?

17:43.440 --> 17:44.530
Don't worry, Your Highness.

17:44.550 --> 17:46.560
I'll have someone bring a ladder.

18:01.200 --> 18:02.640
Princess Fuqing.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.900
Miss Jiang.

18:03.920 --> 18:07.160
Your Highness,
the kite is on the rooftop.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.580
Yes.

18:08.600 --> 18:10.580
I'll try to knock it down.

18:10.600 --> 18:11.980
That'd be great.

18:12.000 --> 18:13.420
But Ms. Hua said

18:13.440 --> 18:15.020
it was stuck quite high up.

18:15.040 --> 18:16.500
Can you reach it?

18:16.520 --> 18:17.960
It is quite high.

18:18.080 --> 18:19.520
Let me give it a try.

18:37.360 --> 18:38.800
Here it is.

18:41.800 --> 18:43.560
I got it. Take a look.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.660
Is it broken?

18:45.680 --> 18:47.200
No, it's perfectly fine.

18:47.440 --> 18:49.060
But the string snapped.

18:49.080 --> 18:50.620
Your Highness, hold it.

18:50.640 --> 18:51.600
I'll just tie

18:51.600 --> 18:53.240
the string back.

18:54.600 --> 18:55.980
Is it reattached?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.260
Yes.

18:57.280 --> 18:58.720
That's good.

18:59.360 --> 19:01.380
If only everything in this world

19:01.400 --> 19:02.960
could be mended as easily

19:02.960 --> 19:05.040
as a broken kite string.

19:10.480 --> 19:13.200
What do you think of the four candidates

19:13.400 --> 19:14.780
Yu Jin recommended?

19:14.800 --> 19:15.940
Your Majesty,

19:15.960 --> 19:18.800
Captain Xie of Lingshui
has an excellent reputation.

19:18.840 --> 19:20.780
His annual evaluations
at the Civil Affairs

19:20.800 --> 19:22.340
are consistently top-tier.

19:22.360 --> 19:24.120
However, I believe

19:24.600 --> 19:26.160
there is one concern.

19:26.360 --> 19:27.800
What concern?

19:28.640 --> 19:31.080
I heard that Captain Xie
intends to marry

19:31.080 --> 19:33.080
the eldest daughter of Earl Dongping.

19:33.800 --> 19:35.360
If that happens, he'd become

19:35.360 --> 19:37.320
Prince Yan's brother-in-law.

19:37.920 --> 19:40.440
Would that not appear as favoritism?

19:41.120 --> 19:43.780
Calling you inflexible
is no exaggeration.

19:43.800 --> 19:45.240
Favoritism applies

19:45.520 --> 19:47.730
to the unworthy and incompetent.

19:47.860 --> 19:48.980
When it comes to true talent,

19:49.000 --> 19:52.280
it'd be appointing the worthy,
regardless of ties.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.980
Your Majesty,

19:54.000 --> 19:55.620
Prince Yan

19:55.640 --> 19:57.460
became the Commandant

19:57.480 --> 19:58.820
of Capital Security

19:58.840 --> 20:00.960
through the Tournament.

20:01.000 --> 20:03.060
It was accepted by the people.

20:03.080 --> 20:04.360
So, I believe

20:04.380 --> 20:05.560
Capital Security is different

20:05.560 --> 20:06.980
from other government offices.

20:07.000 --> 20:08.720
It's vital to the peace of Ling'an

20:08.720 --> 20:10.160
and the confidence of the people...

20:10.160 --> 20:11.600
Enough, enough.

20:12.600 --> 20:13.760
I summoned you here

20:13.760 --> 20:15.520
not to listen to a lecture.

20:17.720 --> 20:19.220
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

20:19.240 --> 20:20.340
May I ask

20:20.360 --> 20:22.280
why you have summoned me?

20:23.920 --> 20:25.350
Zhen,

20:25.370 --> 20:26.240
look.

20:26.240 --> 20:28.480
Who is that flying the kite?

20:31.680 --> 20:34.800
Are you referring to Miss Jiang Si?

20:35.720 --> 20:36.980
Not Jiang Si.

20:37.000 --> 20:39.040
The one standing beside her.

20:51.160 --> 20:52.600
Princess Fuqing.

20:53.480 --> 20:54.920
Zhen,

20:55.520 --> 20:57.600
I appointed you as her mentor

20:57.600 --> 21:00.120
some time ago.

21:00.520 --> 21:02.040
What do you think of her?

21:03.840 --> 21:05.540
Thanks to your trust,

21:05.560 --> 21:08.580
I've had the honor
of teaching Princess Fuqing.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.700
She is intelligent, quick-witted,

21:10.720 --> 21:12.320
and eager to learn.

21:13.320 --> 21:14.760
And?

21:15.480 --> 21:17.220
She grasps key concepts

21:17.240 --> 21:18.300
of the classics

21:18.320 --> 21:19.840
effortlessly

21:19.860 --> 21:21.500
and can even infer beyond the material,

21:21.520 --> 21:23.420
offering insightful perspectives.

21:23.440 --> 21:24.820
I am truly impressed.

21:24.840 --> 21:26.380
Think again.

21:26.400 --> 21:27.500
Beyond her studies,

21:27.520 --> 21:29.520
what else have you observed?

21:35.160 --> 21:36.600
Indeed.

21:36.680 --> 21:39.100
Though born into nobility,

21:39.120 --> 21:41.420
the Princess is humble
and unpretentious.

21:41.440 --> 21:42.580
She treats the servants

21:42.600 --> 21:43.940
with kindness and generosity,

21:43.960 --> 21:45.620
displaying great compassion.

21:45.640 --> 21:47.080
That's all?

21:48.200 --> 21:49.640
Yes.

21:58.200 --> 22:00.280
The kite is flying now.

22:02.720 --> 22:04.160
It's up in the air.

22:04.480 --> 22:06.320
- Slow down.
- Princess Fuqing.

22:07.460 --> 22:08.320
Are you okay?

22:08.320 --> 22:09.760
I'm fine.

22:18.400 --> 22:21.040
Your Majesty,
sorry for my lapse in composure.

22:25.680 --> 22:28.420
Fuqing is my most beloved daughter,

22:28.440 --> 22:30.580
and the kindest

22:30.600 --> 22:33.240
and most gracious Princess
in the Palace.

22:33.320 --> 22:35.480
I've long wished to find her

22:35.480 --> 22:37.720
an upright and reliable husband.

22:37.880 --> 22:39.320
Zhen,

22:39.440 --> 22:42.120
what do you think of this?

22:45.080 --> 22:46.520
Your Majesty,

22:46.720 --> 22:49.040
I have not yet considered

22:49.040 --> 22:50.300
a suitable candidate.

22:50.320 --> 22:52.660
I will certainly keep an eye out.

22:54.080 --> 22:57.120
You are truly a block of wood.

22:57.360 --> 22:59.040
I'm asking

22:59.160 --> 23:03.720
what you think of Fuqing yourself.

23:16.400 --> 23:17.780
Your Majesty,

23:17.800 --> 23:19.860
the Princess is of noble birth,

23:19.880 --> 23:22.360
while I am merely a scholar.

23:22.440 --> 23:24.360
I dare not think that way.

23:24.520 --> 23:26.000
So,

23:27.000 --> 23:29.240
you do not wish to marry Fuqing?

23:30.280 --> 23:33.180
I have always regarded Princess Fuqing

23:33.200 --> 23:34.680
as my student,

23:36.360 --> 23:37.800
nothing more.

23:56.520 --> 23:58.140
Mr. Zhen refused?

23:58.160 --> 23:59.460
I don't believe it.

23:59.480 --> 24:00.620
Why would I lie to you?

24:00.640 --> 24:02.340
I heard it in the Imperial Garden.

24:02.360 --> 24:03.980
Our Princess is so wonderful.

24:04.000 --> 24:05.200
Whoever marries her

24:05.210 --> 24:06.640
would be truly blessed.

24:06.660 --> 24:07.700
Everyone says that Mr. Zhen

24:07.700 --> 24:09.300
has an unmatched ability to solve cases,

24:09.320 --> 24:10.460
but in my opinion,

24:10.480 --> 24:13.020
he is completely blind.

24:13.040 --> 24:14.400
Princess Fuqing is kind

24:14.400 --> 24:15.320
and gentle.

24:15.320 --> 24:17.180
Besides, she is a lineal Princess.

24:17.200 --> 24:17.820
Logically,

24:17.820 --> 24:18.860
suitors lining up for her

24:18.860 --> 24:20.940
should be from Changning Palace
to Zhengyang Gate.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.640
What are you saying?

24:22.840 --> 24:24.280
Ms. Duo.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.880
Please forgive us.

24:27.080 --> 24:28.940
How dare you gossip

24:28.960 --> 24:30.160
behind the Princess's back?

24:30.160 --> 24:31.840
Ms. Duo, please forgive us.

24:32.080 --> 24:33.400
(Ms. Duo)

24:33.400 --> 24:34.480
Your Highness,

24:34.500 --> 24:36.080
this is my failure in discipline.

24:36.100 --> 24:37.080
- They spoke
- Please...

24:37.080 --> 24:38.200
- out of turn.
- Have mercy.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.840
They should have their tongues cut out.

24:39.840 --> 24:41.080
We won't do it again.

24:41.080 --> 24:42.740
Your Highness, please have mercy.

24:42.760 --> 24:45.380
The Empress has always ruled
the harem with kindness

24:45.400 --> 24:47.160
and dislikes harsh punishments.

24:47.240 --> 24:48.540
I think

24:48.560 --> 24:50.220
docking a month's wages
should be enough

24:50.240 --> 24:51.540
to teach them a lesson.

24:51.560 --> 24:52.400
Absolutely not.

24:52.400 --> 24:53.500
If such a light punishment

24:53.520 --> 24:54.960
is given,

24:54.960 --> 24:56.120
everyone in Changning Palace

24:56.120 --> 24:57.440
will gossip about their masters.

24:57.440 --> 24:58.380
There won't be order.

24:58.400 --> 25:00.140
They weren't exactly
speaking out of turn.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.660
What's there to punish?

25:01.680 --> 25:02.780
Your Highness...

25:02.800 --> 25:04.280
You may leave.

25:04.680 --> 25:06.560
- Thanks.
- Thanks, Your Highness.

25:13.560 --> 25:15.000
Your Highness,

25:15.160 --> 25:17.040
don't take

25:17.560 --> 25:19.080
what they said to heart.

25:19.200 --> 25:20.720
I don't blame them.

25:20.800 --> 25:22.660
Mr. Zhen isn't wrong either.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.880
After all, who would truly love

25:23.880 --> 25:25.620
someone who cannot see?

25:25.640 --> 25:27.980
I never planned on marrying anyway.

25:28.000 --> 25:30.740
I only wish to stay by Mother's side.

25:30.760 --> 25:32.600
Your Highness, have you considered

25:32.760 --> 25:34.480
perhaps Mr. Zhen

25:35.040 --> 25:37.640
does not mind your blindness at all?

25:37.800 --> 25:39.520
Perhaps it is you

25:40.400 --> 25:42.440
who minds it too much,

25:42.560 --> 25:44.400
and over time,

25:44.600 --> 25:46.420
it has become a knot in your heart.

25:46.440 --> 25:48.140
You are right.

25:48.160 --> 25:50.320
It is my burden.

25:50.640 --> 25:52.780
When I speak to others,

25:52.800 --> 25:54.820
I cannot see their eyes.

25:54.840 --> 25:56.160
So, how can I ever tell

25:56.160 --> 25:58.080
if they are sincere?

25:59.600 --> 26:01.160
Maybe one day,

26:01.280 --> 26:03.240
your eyes will be healed.

26:03.280 --> 26:04.500
Then

26:04.520 --> 26:06.780
you can see Mr. Zhen for yourself

26:06.800 --> 26:08.320
and ask him about it.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.640
Miss Jiang,

26:14.720 --> 26:16.260
can you describe

26:16.280 --> 26:17.280
the sky

26:17.280 --> 26:18.960
for me?

26:22.240 --> 26:25.360
Today's sunset is especially beautiful.

26:25.680 --> 26:28.720
It's deep red, like a glowing sphere,

26:28.880 --> 26:32.120
slowly sinking lower and lower.

26:32.280 --> 26:34.280
The clouds at the horizon

26:34.560 --> 26:37.360
are streaked with orange and pink.

26:45.960 --> 26:47.640
I can imagine

26:48.120 --> 26:49.120
that living

26:49.120 --> 26:50.880
in darkness

26:52.360 --> 26:54.200
must be lonely.

26:55.840 --> 26:57.300
Miss Jiang Si,

26:57.320 --> 26:59.160
life in the Palace is lonely.

26:59.520 --> 27:00.720
Other than Mother,

27:00.720 --> 27:03.400
I have no one to confide in.

27:03.480 --> 27:05.360
No one has ever said

27:05.360 --> 27:07.560
what you said today to me before.

27:09.320 --> 27:10.380
Don't worry.

27:10.400 --> 27:12.640
We'll have endless things to talk about.

27:13.080 --> 27:14.040
Look.

27:14.040 --> 27:16.140
I have an older brother and sister,

27:16.160 --> 27:17.740
but I don't have a younger sister.

27:17.760 --> 27:19.500
Since you are Prince Yan's sister,

27:19.520 --> 27:21.440
you are naturally my sister as well.

27:21.760 --> 27:23.900
I'll visit the Palace often
to keep you company.

27:23.920 --> 27:25.880
We'll share many more secrets.

27:27.360 --> 27:30.880
(Peace and Prosperity)

27:34.960 --> 27:36.680
I didn't see anything.

27:38.080 --> 27:40.660
Aunt, I didn't see anything.

27:40.680 --> 27:42.200
I didn't see anything, Aunt.

27:42.200 --> 27:44.280
I didn't see anything.

27:44.280 --> 27:45.820
I didn't see anything!

27:45.840 --> 27:47.280
Your Highness.

27:48.680 --> 27:50.020
It's me, Jiang.

27:50.040 --> 27:51.220
Don't be afraid.

27:51.240 --> 27:52.780
Did you have a nightmare?

27:53.000 --> 27:54.440
Don't be afraid.

27:54.600 --> 27:55.820
I'm here.

27:55.840 --> 27:57.360
I heard you saying,

27:58.040 --> 27:59.800
"I didn't see anything."

28:00.320 --> 28:01.280
No...

28:01.280 --> 28:03.400
What could frighten you so much?

28:04.000 --> 28:05.940
Is it related to the Grand Princess?

28:05.960 --> 28:07.680
I told you I didn't see anything.

28:07.680 --> 28:09.520
Don't ask me.

28:11.520 --> 28:13.440
I saw nothing.

28:14.120 --> 28:15.800
I cannot say.

28:17.120 --> 28:19.920
Alright, don't be afraid, Fuqing.

28:20.400 --> 28:21.840
Rest assured.

28:22.640 --> 28:24.840
We will do our best

28:25.000 --> 28:26.880
to find a way to heal your eyes.

28:29.320 --> 28:30.760
Don't be afraid.

28:30.840 --> 28:32.280
Don't be afraid.

28:32.360 --> 28:33.800
I'm here.

28:33.960 --> 28:35.400
I'm here.

28:47.240 --> 28:49.260
Why prepare so much food?

28:49.280 --> 28:50.360
I'm in Changning Palace.

28:50.360 --> 28:52.080
How could I possibly go hungry?

28:52.560 --> 28:53.600
I haven't been by your side

28:53.600 --> 28:55.380
these past few days.

28:55.400 --> 28:58.040
What if you lost your appetite?

28:59.320 --> 29:01.560
So? Any progress?

29:02.480 --> 29:04.060
Based on the Empress's attitude

29:04.080 --> 29:05.360
toward the Grand Princess

29:05.380 --> 29:07.380
these days,

29:07.400 --> 29:08.240
I'm sure

29:08.240 --> 29:10.670
their relationship is strained.

29:10.690 --> 29:12.360
In fact, the Empress

29:12.360 --> 29:14.240
seems to fear the Grand Princess.

29:15.360 --> 29:16.960
She has poor relations

29:16.960 --> 29:18.880
with many consorts in the harem.

29:19.720 --> 29:21.640
Supporting the Empress

29:22.080 --> 29:23.900
doesn't necessarily mean anything.

29:23.920 --> 29:26.060
Perhaps she just finds her
easier to use.

29:27.320 --> 29:29.580
Empress Di has no sons,

29:29.600 --> 29:30.980
her family holds no power,

29:31.000 --> 29:32.080
and in the past,

29:32.080 --> 29:34.360
she never received much favor.

29:34.720 --> 29:36.620
To the Grand Princess,

29:36.640 --> 29:38.760
these weaknesses might be seen

29:39.000 --> 29:40.440
as advantages.

29:41.280 --> 29:43.020
These advantages make her

29:43.040 --> 29:44.720
easier to control.

29:45.680 --> 29:46.600
By the way,

29:46.600 --> 29:47.440
last night,

29:47.440 --> 29:48.910
Princess Fuqing had a nightmare.

29:48.930 --> 29:50.660
She kept calling out for her aunt

29:50.680 --> 29:51.780
in her sleep,

29:51.800 --> 29:53.630
saying she didn't

29:53.880 --> 29:55.520
see anything.

29:56.200 --> 29:58.340
The more she insisted she saw nothing,

29:58.360 --> 30:00.760
the more likely it was
that she saw a secret.

30:01.280 --> 30:02.160
I suspect

30:02.160 --> 30:04.380
it must be something truly terrifying,

30:04.400 --> 30:06.700
so she's been afraid to speak of it,

30:06.720 --> 30:08.580
fearing that the Grand Princess
will retaliate

30:08.600 --> 30:10.160
and harm Empress Di.

30:12.360 --> 30:14.360
Do you think her blindness

30:14.640 --> 30:16.880
is connected to this?

30:19.120 --> 30:20.080
If the Grand Princess

30:20.080 --> 30:21.780
has spies from Nanwu

30:21.800 --> 30:23.180
hidden in Changning Palace,

30:23.200 --> 30:24.460
then this person

30:24.480 --> 30:26.840
could both gather intelligence

30:27.160 --> 30:28.960
and keep an eye on Fuqing,

30:29.120 --> 30:31.280
preventing her
from revealing the secret.

30:33.280 --> 30:35.300
Should we tell the Empress

30:35.320 --> 30:36.740
about this?

30:36.760 --> 30:38.700
Would she

30:38.720 --> 30:40.440
make Fuqing confess?

30:41.360 --> 30:44.000
Fuqing has kept this
from the Empress for years.

30:44.120 --> 30:45.000
She must be

30:45.000 --> 30:46.860
suffering immensely.

30:46.880 --> 30:49.260
We can't reveal this

30:49.280 --> 30:51.420
without her permission.

30:51.440 --> 30:52.700
Yes.

30:52.720 --> 30:54.160
Right now,

30:54.200 --> 30:55.460
our top priority

30:55.480 --> 30:56.600
is finding the spy

30:56.600 --> 30:58.220
in Changning Palace.

30:58.240 --> 30:59.360
We cannot let them continue

30:59.360 --> 31:00.980
to wreak havoc in the harem.

31:02.000 --> 31:02.880
But there are

31:02.880 --> 31:04.920
so many maids here.

31:05.560 --> 31:07.260
We'll have to check the palace registry.

31:07.280 --> 31:08.580
From my observations,

31:08.600 --> 31:11.020
two people seem suspicious.

31:11.040 --> 31:11.920
Who?

31:11.920 --> 31:13.260
One is Ms. Duo;

31:13.280 --> 31:14.460
the other is Ms. Hua.

31:14.480 --> 31:15.560
They spoke

31:15.560 --> 31:16.440
out of turn.

31:16.440 --> 31:18.180
They should have their tongues cut out.

31:18.200 --> 31:20.380
The Empress has always ruled
the harem with kindness

31:20.380 --> 31:21.600
and dislikes harsh punishments.

31:21.600 --> 31:22.700
Ms. Duo's family

31:22.720 --> 31:24.500
once ran a martial arts school.

31:24.520 --> 31:26.180
She knows some combat skills,

31:26.200 --> 31:27.380
rarely smiles,

31:27.400 --> 31:29.160
and is highly decisive.

31:29.400 --> 31:30.600
When handling maids,

31:30.600 --> 31:31.900
she is utterly ruthless.

31:31.920 --> 31:34.300
Ms. Hua is an orphan.

31:34.320 --> 31:35.580
She is always warm

31:35.600 --> 31:36.900
and cheerful

31:36.920 --> 31:38.680
and never argues with anyone.

31:40.200 --> 31:41.680
But she is only

31:41.680 --> 31:43.660
in charge of daily affairs,

31:43.680 --> 31:45.740
so she has no reason
to leave the Palace.

31:45.760 --> 31:47.020
Ms. Duo, however,

31:47.040 --> 31:48.740
works for the Empress

31:48.760 --> 31:50.900
and has many opportunities
to go outside.

31:51.080 --> 31:52.180
Not leaving the Palace

31:52.200 --> 31:54.540
doesn't mean she has no way
to send messages.

31:54.920 --> 31:56.640
Carrier pigeons could be used.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.880
Carrier pigeons?

32:07.440 --> 32:09.140
I noticed scratches

32:09.160 --> 32:10.840
on Ms. Hua's fingers,

32:11.440 --> 32:12.840
the kind left by pigeon claws.

32:12.840 --> 32:14.220
That matches up perfectly.

32:14.240 --> 32:15.680
Could Ms. Hua

32:15.960 --> 32:17.760
really be the spy?

32:18.280 --> 32:19.720
We must act quickly.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.800
Let's inform the Empress at once.

32:22.800 --> 32:24.440
You also want to learn etiquette?

32:24.460 --> 32:25.740
Yes.

32:25.760 --> 32:28.080
Jiang Si's father is an Earl.

32:28.080 --> 32:30.480
Her manners are far better than mine.

32:30.780 --> 32:33.140
If she performs flawlessly
at the wedding

32:33.160 --> 32:34.240
while I make a mistake,

32:34.240 --> 32:35.980
it would be utterly humiliating.

32:36.000 --> 32:37.200
But I can't stay

32:37.200 --> 32:38.860
in the Palace to study,

32:38.880 --> 32:40.700
so I wanted to borrow

32:40.720 --> 32:42.160
Ms. Hua for a while.

32:42.240 --> 32:43.660
Ms. Hua?

32:43.680 --> 32:45.160
What are you two up to?

32:45.160 --> 32:46.560
I just want

32:46.560 --> 32:48.480
to learn proper etiquette.

32:48.680 --> 32:52.240
Fine then.

32:54.040 --> 32:55.980
Your Highness, I don't want to go.

32:56.000 --> 32:58.460
But Prince Yan asked for you.

32:58.480 --> 33:00.760
- Your Highness...
- Go pack.

33:05.080 --> 33:06.520
Yes.

33:09.720 --> 33:11.260
Thank you, Your Highness.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.400
Prince Yan,

33:18.200 --> 33:19.320
can I trust

33:19.320 --> 33:20.860
you and Jiang Si?

33:20.880 --> 33:22.320
After my return,

33:22.540 --> 33:24.440
you are the only one in the Palace

33:24.530 --> 33:26.080
who has treated me kindly.

33:27.680 --> 33:29.600
You're a good child,

33:30.170 --> 33:31.800
and so is Jiang Si.

33:35.320 --> 33:38.840
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

33:45.360 --> 33:46.800
Ms. Hua,

33:47.000 --> 33:48.720
we've arrived. Come out.

33:49.280 --> 33:52.020
You refused to leave the Palace,

33:52.040 --> 33:53.280
but we're at the doorstep now.

33:53.280 --> 33:55.600
There's no need to hide
in the sedan chair.

34:08.440 --> 34:10.420
Your Highness, you misunderstand.

34:10.440 --> 34:12.120
I am not unwilling.

34:12.200 --> 34:14.260
Since I entered the Palace at 13,

34:14.280 --> 34:16.740
I have never stepped outside.

34:16.760 --> 34:18.960
Everything out there has changed.

34:18.960 --> 34:21.240
The outside world is

34:21.240 --> 34:23.460
no longer the one I knew.

34:23.480 --> 34:25.020
Is that what troubles you?

34:25.040 --> 34:27.920
Yes, you wouldn't understand.

34:28.840 --> 34:30.680
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

34:33.440 --> 34:34.880
Wait.

34:34.920 --> 34:36.780
The flowers in your mansion

34:36.800 --> 34:38.380
are common in my hometown.

34:38.400 --> 34:41.320
Seeing them again feels so familiar.

34:41.400 --> 34:42.840
It seems you and Lingshui

34:42.840 --> 34:43.880
are truly connected.

34:43.880 --> 34:44.900
Where?

34:44.920 --> 34:46.360
Lingshui?

34:58.680 --> 35:00.120
Miss Jiang.

35:00.560 --> 35:01.980
It's you.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.120
Did you plant the Mang Worm

35:03.120 --> 35:04.460
in Princess Fuqing's eyes?

35:04.480 --> 35:05.540
It was me.

35:05.560 --> 35:07.780
How does a noble lady of Dazhou like you

35:07.800 --> 35:09.200
know so much about Mang Worms

35:09.200 --> 35:10.200
from Nanwu?

35:10.200 --> 35:11.880
How did you find out?

35:16.880 --> 35:18.600
In that case,

35:19.120 --> 35:20.200
Miss Jiang,

35:20.200 --> 35:22.120
you've known too much.

35:22.280 --> 35:24.280
I'm afraid I must do this.

35:30.760 --> 35:33.760
(Peace and Prosperity)

35:38.720 --> 35:39.570
Where is Miss Jiang?

35:39.580 --> 35:41.800
She is in the back garden with Ms. Duo.

35:48.760 --> 35:50.120
Let go of me. I'm fine.

35:50.120 --> 35:51.120
She is a Nanwu woman.

35:51.120 --> 35:53.010
She can save Princess Fuqing.

35:56.830 --> 35:58.060
Though she's a Nanwu woman,

35:58.080 --> 35:59.380
I have confirmed

35:59.400 --> 36:00.240
that she planted

36:00.240 --> 36:01.460
the gu worm

36:01.480 --> 36:02.940
in the Princess's eyes.

36:02.960 --> 36:04.640
So, she knows how to cure it.

36:05.600 --> 36:07.560
Tell me how.

36:07.680 --> 36:09.200
I'm just clearing obstacles

36:09.200 --> 36:10.220
for the Grand Princess.

36:10.240 --> 36:11.460
Ms. Duo,

36:11.480 --> 36:12.500
I'm the Saintess.

36:12.520 --> 36:13.980
Will you serve me

36:14.000 --> 36:15.620
or the Grand Princess?

36:15.640 --> 36:17.080
You choose.

36:36.040 --> 36:37.180
Greetings, Saintess.

36:37.200 --> 36:38.920
Please punish me.

36:41.160 --> 36:42.740
Yes, Saintess.

36:42.760 --> 36:43.820
Tell us how to remove

36:43.840 --> 36:44.920
the gu worm.

36:44.920 --> 36:46.260
A few herbs from Imperial Pharmacy

36:46.260 --> 36:47.360
will suffice.

36:47.520 --> 36:48.580
That's all?

36:48.600 --> 36:50.040
Yes.

36:51.040 --> 36:53.180
Alright, I'll take you to get them now.

36:53.200 --> 36:54.780
(It's simple to remove the worm.)

36:54.800 --> 36:56.440
(Wrap realgar powder in a cyan cloth, )

36:56.440 --> 36:58.920
(add pangolin scale powder
and snake bile, )

37:01.840 --> 37:03.260
(dip it in warm wine, )

37:03.280 --> 37:05.480
(and repeatedly wipe around the eyes.)

37:06.200 --> 37:07.780
(When the worm cannot withstand it, )

37:07.800 --> 37:09.240
(it will leave her body.)

37:12.000 --> 37:13.440
Miss Jiang.

37:17.120 --> 37:19.880
Your Highness, I'm about to begin.

37:19.960 --> 37:20.960
Remember:

37:20.960 --> 37:22.540
No matter how much it hurts,

37:22.560 --> 37:24.480
you must keep your eyes shut

37:24.600 --> 37:26.460
until I tell you to open them,

37:26.480 --> 37:27.920
alright?

37:28.240 --> 37:29.680
Sure.

37:42.200 --> 37:43.200
- Fuqing.
- Mother.

37:43.200 --> 37:44.300
Fuqing, can you bear it?

37:44.300 --> 37:45.500
- I know it hurts.
- Fuqing.

37:45.520 --> 37:46.960
Hang in there.

37:47.520 --> 37:49.300
- Fuqing.
- Ms. Duo.

37:49.320 --> 37:50.760
Fuqing.

37:51.040 --> 37:52.040
Mother.

37:52.040 --> 37:53.480
Fuqing.

37:55.520 --> 37:56.520
Your Majesty,

37:56.520 --> 37:57.400
Miss Jiang has started

37:57.400 --> 37:59.360
removing the worm.

38:00.000 --> 38:01.380
Father.

38:01.400 --> 38:03.000
Hang in there.

38:03.600 --> 38:05.600
(Glorious Fortune)
It's almost done.

38:06.480 --> 38:07.360
Ms. Duo, hurry.

38:07.360 --> 38:08.800
Father.

38:09.640 --> 38:10.860
She's treating her inside.

38:10.880 --> 38:12.500
- You'd better not go in.
- Mother.

38:12.520 --> 38:14.320
She is just a young girl.

38:14.640 --> 38:16.680
Why must she endure such pain?

38:17.560 --> 38:19.000
Jin,

38:19.280 --> 38:21.240
did the wounds you suffered in the South

38:21.240 --> 38:23.120
also hurt as much?

38:24.040 --> 38:25.480
Father,

38:26.440 --> 38:28.100
I am a man.

38:28.120 --> 38:29.560
I do not fear pain.

38:34.080 --> 38:35.500
It's all my fault

38:35.520 --> 38:37.720
for making you suffer so much

38:38.040 --> 38:39.800
and enduring so many hardships.

38:43.960 --> 38:45.560
(The worm has a spirit.)

38:45.680 --> 38:47.680
- (It's been there for ten years.)
- Mother.

38:47.680 --> 38:48.640
(It knows)

38:48.640 --> 38:50.740
(there is no better host.)

38:50.760 --> 38:52.260
(We're forcing it out, )

38:52.280 --> 38:54.090
- (so it'll resist.)
- It hurts.

38:54.140 --> 38:56.260
(The pain will feel like her heart
being gnawed away.)

38:56.280 --> 38:57.980
(It's a contest of endurance)

38:58.000 --> 38:59.260
(between the worm)

38:59.280 --> 39:00.720
(and the Princess.)

39:03.260 --> 39:04.560
Your Highness, it's almost over.

39:04.560 --> 39:06.460
Hold on, Fuqing.

39:06.480 --> 39:07.920
Mother.

39:10.400 --> 39:11.620
It's almost over.

39:11.640 --> 39:13.600
Your Highness, it's almost over.

39:15.080 --> 39:16.520
It hurts.

39:21.160 --> 39:22.600
It hurts so much.

39:31.320 --> 39:32.460
- One last time.
- Mother.

39:32.480 --> 39:33.740
Your Highness, hold on.

39:33.760 --> 39:34.800
One last time.

39:34.800 --> 39:36.800
Your Highness, it's almost over.

39:43.520 --> 39:44.700
It's out, Your Highness.

39:44.720 --> 39:45.900
It's out.

39:45.920 --> 39:47.920
Your Highness, don't open your eyes.

39:53.880 --> 39:55.320
Here.

39:55.800 --> 39:57.240
Fuqing.

40:27.600 --> 40:30.760
(Grand Elder, I saw the Saintess.)

40:35.640 --> 40:38.120
(Glorious Fortune)

40:38.120 --> 40:42.640
(Blessings and Clarity)

41:00.000 --> 41:01.440
Your Highness,

41:01.640 --> 41:03.600
you can open your eyes now.

41:07.120 --> 41:08.560
Fuqing?

41:09.800 --> 41:11.240
Fuqing.

41:38.040 --> 41:39.480
Mother.

41:42.200 --> 41:43.760
Your eyes...

41:43.960 --> 41:45.840
My child, you have suffered.

41:46.080 --> 41:50.400
You can finally see again.

41:54.960 --> 41:56.840
Your Majesty.

41:56.840 --> 41:58.680
The Princess can see.

42:01.760 --> 42:03.200
Fuqing.

42:03.720 --> 42:05.160
Fuqing,

42:06.240 --> 42:08.240
can you see me clearly?

42:09.880 --> 42:11.320
Father.

42:17.360 --> 42:19.720
Why do you look so much older?

42:24.480 --> 42:26.120
I've aged.

42:31.600 --> 42:33.320
How wonderful, Miss Jiang.

42:35.960 --> 42:37.900
Jiang Si, Jin,

42:37.920 --> 42:40.000
you have rendered great service.

42:40.080 --> 42:42.520
Tell me. What reward do you want?

42:43.360 --> 42:44.900
Thank you, Your Majesty.

42:45.120 --> 42:47.500
This is my first time
receiving a reward.

42:47.520 --> 42:48.600
Please allow me

42:48.600 --> 42:50.140
to think it over.

42:50.160 --> 42:52.360
Sure. Go ahead.

42:53.360 --> 42:56.040
Come on. Let me take another look.

42:57.200 --> 43:01.520
(The End of Episode 31)

43:01.971 --> 43:03.701
♪ From place to place ♪

43:03.701 --> 43:08.641
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:09.011 --> 43:11.391
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:11.391 --> 43:15.621
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:16.331 --> 43:18.731
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:18.751 --> 43:22.411
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:22.431 --> 43:25.851
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:26.001 --> 43:31.521
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:32.341 --> 43:36.021
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:36.021 --> 43:40.101
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:40.341 --> 43:42.081
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:42.101 --> 43:46.801
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:46.801 --> 43:50.371
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:50.391 --> 43:54.621
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:54.641 --> 43:56.421
♪ Time glows ♪

43:56.421 --> 44:00.961
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:00.981 --> 44:05.781
♪ And stars ♪

44:10.011 --> 44:12.541
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:12.561 --> 44:16.181
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:16.201 --> 44:19.631
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:19.651 --> 44:24.271
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:24.271 --> 44:27.961
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:27.981 --> 44:32.071
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:32.181 --> 44:34.001
♪ Time glows ♪

44:34.001 --> 44:38.551
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:38.571 --> 44:42.271
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:42.291 --> 44:46.451
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:46.631 --> 44:48.391
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:48.391 --> 44:52.911
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:52.911 --> 44:56.551
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:56.571 --> 45:02.241
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

45:03.931 --> 45:05.861
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:05.861 --> 45:13.361
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
